  skos:definition "4) уничтожать, погублять, разрушать, устранять: {#bAhUnivatOnmA cCetsIH#} (lege {#CE˚#})\n<ls>MBH. 2,1942.</ls> {#tataSCetsyati nArAcErjagatsarvaM sarAkzasam#}\n<ls>R. 3,70,20.</ls> {#(SataGnIm) ASAM ca suradvizAM — vAREScicCeda#}\n<ls>RAGH. 12,96.</ls> {#pratizWAm#}\n<ls>ŚAT. BR. 10,5,2,5.</ls> {#Cidyante sarvasaMSayAH#}\n<ls>MUṆḌ. UP. 2,2,8.</ls> {#etaM me saMSayaM sarvaM Cettumarhati#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,6890.</ls> {#saMdehaM me — tattvataSCettumarhasi#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">3,4030.</ls> {#geharatiM Cinatti#}\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 3,5,11.</ls> {#CindyAdasaNgaSastreRa spfhAm#}\n<ls n=\"BHĀG. P.\">2,1,15.</ls> {#kriyAM nIlapurARoktAmacCindannAgamadvizaH#}\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 1,178.</ls> {#tfzRAM CinattyAtmanaH#}\n<ls>PAÑCAT. II,128.</ls> <ls>BHARTṚ. 2,70.</ls> {#duHKaM CindyAmahaM te vE#}\n<ls>MBH.</ls> in <ls>BENF. Chr. 12,25.</ls> {#kOtUhalaM naH paramaM tacCinDi#}\n<ls>HARIV. 7730.</ls> {#fRaM CittvA#} погасить долг\n[Page2-1091]\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 6,16.</ls>"@ru ;
